                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/><g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g> 824 śaka gi nu mān(·) [vraḥ śāsana] dhūli vraḥ pāda [dhūli jeṅ·]
   <lb n="2"/>vraḥ kaṁmrateṅ· Añ· ta stac(·) [dau parama]śivaloka kāla pre {5}
   <lb n="3"/>pati dau cāp· kanrassa <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> nau {5} kanras· pi {6}
   <lb n="4"/>phsok· nu dhana phoṅa siddhi <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> gotrakula {2} kanras· {5}
   <lb n="5"/>phsokka man· cāṁ jmaḥ tai kanden· <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> tai kanden· man· {8}
   <lb n="6"/>kvan· kañ{1} ta jmah· kaṁvrau <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> mān· kvan· kaṁvrau ta jmah· kanlak· @ [mān· kvan·]
   <lb n="7"/>kanlakka ta jmah· tai kanrau tai kaṁprvat· si pandan· si kaṁpit· mān· kvan· {3}
   <lb n="8"/>ta jmah· thkot mān· kvan· kaṁprvat ta jmah· vani <g ref="sym:bullet-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g> man· lvoh· k{4}
   <lb n="9"/>hoṅ· neḥ tai kanrau qval· śāpa dai man· vlvac· khmi prabandha {5}
   <lb n="10"/>ta rūpa gurujana Añ· <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g>
</p>     
</div>
